Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.02,0:00:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every\Nwall that's in our wake!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.04,0:00:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the answers we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to this new world\Nbelieving that surely someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We just might find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.02,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of our dreams\Nhave now come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bonds won't waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With our dreaming end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.66,0:01:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.28,0:01:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.46,0:01:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.68,0:01:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,way up high always step up if\Nwaves erupt up to the sky never
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,give up our wishes they will come\Ntogether and lead us on for the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.56,0:01:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,future we drift on riding the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.18,0:01:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,waves towards another shore day by
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.36,0:01:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,day there are many meetings many
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.26,0:01:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,goodbyes underneath the flag we fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.08,0:01:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember the pain within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it in my heart forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And never take it lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom I will keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep holding on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.54,0:01:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.58,0:02:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.24,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.80,0:02:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up, keep your\Nhead up, way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up, if waves are\Nrough, jump through the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up, our wishes,\Nthey will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on towards our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.98,0:02:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.70,0:02:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying the gas\Ndidn't affect you at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.48,0:02:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.39,0:02:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk himself designed these\Nprotective suits and it turns out
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.98,0:02:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar Clown's evil brain just ain't\Nno match for that guy's genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.92,0:02:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And Caesar knew that, the bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.00,0:02:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he told the\Nguys out in the field
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.84,0:02:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,that the suits wouldn't do them any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.72,0:02:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.68,0:02:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.26,0:02:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your suits won't protect you\Nand they'll just slow you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.10,0:02:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So fast the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.44,0:02:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That evil SOB got a whole\Nton of our friends petrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.46,0:03:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move out! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If Caesar's telling the\Ntruth, we can rescue them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.74,0:03:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though they're paralyzed in the\Nshells, they're just in a coma-like state.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.86,0:03:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, we've only got 12 hours to find\Nthem before the poison does kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So any gas statue you\Nfind, bust it wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.12,0:03:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.76,0:03:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a good man letting us come back\Nonto the island to search for our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.80,0:03:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget you and\Nwhat you've done for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I find my\Nfollowers and save them,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll come\Nback and turn myself in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.94,0:03:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you will, because\Nthis is the only exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.90,0:03:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get moving already. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:03:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Never dealt with anything\Nlike this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.18,0:03:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do we do with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.48,0:04:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, they're some kind of pirates, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.94,0:04:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but they're creeping me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.26,0:04:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.17,0:04:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like severed heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.08,0:04:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, you was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.46,0:04:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Those artists.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.37,0:04:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.34,0:04:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.62,0:04:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.52,0:04:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Flamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.20,0:04:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,he's using the conqueror's\NHaki but why you're on our side
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.44,0:04:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,because this isn't about you their\Nship is gone you're a warlord what
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.16,0:05:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you doing attacking in the navy?\NThe pirates had to have shipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.64,0:05:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,out within the last hour or two at
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.58,0:05:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,most now tell me where they went how
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.56,0:05:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,dare you attack our guys don't do
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It, you damn fool, get control of my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.86,0:05:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,i can understand law but the straw\Nhats are nothing more than upstarts
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.18,0:05:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't do it. Why would\Nyou bastards let them go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.04,0:05:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me where they went.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.76,0:05:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, just let me live.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.76,0:05:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You messed with my soldiers, now\Nyou're gonna have to deal with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.86,0:06:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be able to tell me\Nwhich direction those punks went.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.00,0:06:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,After we leave here, I'm thinking\Nabout heading over to Greenbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.02,0:06:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We almost caught them, but they got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.76,0:06:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt base commander Vergo\Nis gonna be happy with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.50,0:06:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We both know that he's dead
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.14,0:06:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means you know\Nfar too much from my taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.58,0:06:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.20,0:07:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop struggling and die with some dignity
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.28,0:07:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Smokey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.19,0:07:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't stand here and let him kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Smokey, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:08:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I get you asking about it,\Nand you're not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.24,0:08:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody's worried about the Mini Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.84,0:08:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.32,0:08:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, you're the eighth person\NI've had to explain this to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I took the Sunny up a channel by\Nthe lab to get back out to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.86,0:08:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I circled back\Naround to the dock where
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.92,0:08:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,we first landed to retrieve\Nthe Mini-Mary. Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Very fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.14,0:08:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how our sweet little lamb\Ncame back to us safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Good story.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.94,0:08:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, what's the next\Nstop you got charted?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.10,0:08:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, give me a second here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.58,0:08:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've set the course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.94,0:08:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There won't be any stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.18,0:08:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.09,0:08:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight to Dressrosa. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.18,0:08:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dressrosa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.36,0:08:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the place? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, that is\Nthe exact destination that we,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.88,0:08:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,or rather I, was hoping to reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.86,0:08:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That is your destination as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.72,0:08:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, or I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.08,0:08:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the current shifting?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.18,0:08:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we on a slope? Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.66,0:09:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, we're moving crazy fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.52,0:09:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out for reefs while you're up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.64,0:09:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Can anyone explain what's happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.80,0:09:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on a sea hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.96,0:09:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not uncommon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.00,0:09:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.32,0:09:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The middle needle on\Nyour log post should be
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.28,0:09:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,pointing us in the exact\Ndirection of Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't steer us straight there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.02,0:09:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to take a roundabout way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's something I've been wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.52,0:09:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw you talking to someone on\Nthe transponder snail earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.74,0:09:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell us who it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.76,0:09:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.67,0:09:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the warlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.10,0:09:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the most evil one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why talk to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.76,0:09:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan's in action, so\Nthere's no backing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.24,0:09:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to fill us in?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.54,0:09:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's tell him about the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather round, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You've formed an alliance to\Nkill one of the four emperors?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.42,0:09:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, this plan is pretty great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.60,0:09:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, everyone just\Ncalm down for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.06,0:09:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Luffy, can you\Nexplain this alliance to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.14,0:09:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.05,0:09:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Our crew is teaming up with\NTraffy's pirate crew to do stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,so let's all try to get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.42,0:10:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All against this idea? Me! Me! Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think that's going\Nto make any sort of difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.98,0:10:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what happens once\NLuffy's made up his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.52,0:10:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.18,0:10:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a word of warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Try not to act too surprised\Nif it turns out there's a bit
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.92,0:10:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,of a difference in how you and\NLuffy define the term alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.30,0:10:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been warned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.74,0:10:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,At least the whole kidnapping\Nthing makes sense now,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.36,0:10:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,considering it's not Luffy's style.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.02,0:10:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Usually, if he'd brought\Nthis weird sheep on board,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.42,0:10:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have assumed he wanted me to\Nthrow it in a pot and cook it up for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.68,0:10:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you simpletons honestly believe that\Nyou're going to get away with this madness?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.66,0:10:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to have some of the most\Npowerful names in the world hunting you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.54,0:10:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You pea-brained savages, your\Nstupidity will be your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.28,0:10:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a special place in hell for...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.50,0:10:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not cool, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.02,0:10:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still treating him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.24,0:10:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait till I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.76,0:10:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What, and then it's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.82,0:11:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys executed stage\None of the plan when
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.48,0:11:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you to kidnap\NCaesar on Punk Hazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.28,0:11:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And while you were doing that,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.88,0:11:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I destroyed the machine\Nmanufacturing the chemical SAD.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.96,0:11:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of the great pirates in the New\NWorld rule over their own territories,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.38,0:11:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,governed by their subordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.06,0:11:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got a countless\Nnumber of followers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.22,0:11:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and they reign over all like\Nan enormous criminal syndicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.56,0:11:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing like anything any\Nof you have dealt with before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.14,0:11:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to take them down with\Na single pirate crew won't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.74,0:11:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,even get you close enough\Nto see their captain's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.76,0:11:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,With that said,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.76,0:11:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,they still have to operate underground\Nall their deals are carried out in secret;
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.08,0:11:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,it's the only way they can\Nsafely avoid naval attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.92,0:11:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And the most trusted among them,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.72,0:11:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the one with easily the most power\Nand influence, is Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.72,0:11:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,His underground alias is Joker, and\Nout of all of Joker's business deals,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.64,0:12:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,he's got one client who's\Nmore important than the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.02,0:12:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,His biggest spender is\None of the four emperors,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.88,0:12:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido—the king of the\Nbeasts—and there you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our target, surely?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.36,0:12:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot hope to defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.26,0:12:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.66,0:12:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't mind me; by all means, go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.56,0:12:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,go on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.48,0:12:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this dragon doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.44,0:12:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Momonosuke go? That is Momo
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.82,0:12:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting back to the point
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.04,0:12:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If we want to defeat\NKaido We have to strike
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.48,0:12:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,at his alliances Before\Nwe face him head on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.46,0:12:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the deal He's getting a\Nbunch of devil fruits from Joker
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.06,0:12:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A mass produced Snow type called Smile
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.02,0:12:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They can make those So\Nhe can cook up a whole
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.18,0:12:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,army of people with Snow\Npowers if he wants to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.16,0:12:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.82,0:12:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you so calm about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.82,0:13:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the man-made\Nfruits aren't quite stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.46,0:13:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But even with the risk involved, Kaido's\Narmy now has over 500 power holders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who doesn't want to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.70,0:13:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.58,0:13:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you shut up, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.86,0:13:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, at least we stopped\Nthem from producing more fruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.22,0:13:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.13,0:13:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one who was making them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's what S .A .D.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.52,0:13:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,does?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.43,0:13:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,They use it to make devil fruits?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.82,0:13:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.40,0:13:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't praise him! S.A.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.18,0:13:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,is that hard to make?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Only he can do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Vegapunk's discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.02,0:13:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar just put lineage\Nfactor to practical use.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.66,0:13:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew this guy was crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.48,0:13:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm not a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.90,0:13:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you try making S .A .D.!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.80,0:13:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even have the sense\Nto stop running your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.56,0:13:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We've stopped the source of production.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.74,0:13:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Next step is to wipe out the distribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.66,0:14:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a factory on Dressrosa that\Nmanufactures and ships the stuff out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.02,0:14:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're saying we should\Ngo and bust the place up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.98,0:14:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't just watch his empire crumble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.32,0:14:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He has powerful followers, so\Nwe should be ready for a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.86,0:14:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dressrosa, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.77,0:14:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you needed to go\Nthere too, right, Keen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.48,0:14:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.72,0:14:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,One of my comrades is there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.16,0:14:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Held prisoner by our foe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.38,0:14:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.14,0:14:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We've done his mess, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.46,0:14:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.64,0:14:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't take him from us! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.54,0:14:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're nothing but a bunch of misfits!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the only one who has faith in us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.48,0:14:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Much as I wish I could,\NI can't read minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.30,0:14:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So every last one of you might\Nknow more than you should not
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.84,0:14:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,just you same goes for law on the\NStraw Hat the whole island, too
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.28,0:14:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll just have to kill you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.20,0:15:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on there
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.90,0:15:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me for the intrusion
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.72,0:15:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I need you to step aside
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.28,0:15:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That man you intend on killing right there
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.06,0:15:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an old friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.38,0:15:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what the hell's Aokiji doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.28,0:15:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.38,0:15:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Young master!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.64,0:16:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not really looking\Nto pick a fight with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But you should encourage your\Nfriend to keep his trap shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.74,0:16:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You might not like how\Nthings go otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.58,0:16:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,While we're here, let me\Nask you something. Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not a marine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.34,0:16:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So what the hell are you, Kuzan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reputation's not too good these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.04,0:17:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to give the\Nman some first aid or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.68,0:17:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.22,0:17:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a difference in the look of a\Nvagabond and that of a man newly determined.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.40,0:17:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's found a purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.56,0:17:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see it in his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.28,0:17:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought the world\Ngovernment was absolute, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.44,0:17:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's plenty of things I can accomplish
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.52,0:17:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,in this world without\Nbeing a navy admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.36,0:17:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And plenty of things I can see now that I
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.16,0:17:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,was blind to before I was as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.36,0:18:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well maybe it was faith that brought\Nme here—why'd you really come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.38,0:18:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.32,0:18:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.42,0:18:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And how did you know where I'd be?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're in with\Nthe black market dealers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.98,0:18:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.88,0:18:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you go from the Navy to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.36,0:18:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're done patching\Nthem up, then scram!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.66,0:18:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoker, I'm still me. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.66,0:18:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.66,0:18:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you should keep\Nan eye on Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not just a warlord,\Nbut the king of Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.88,0:18:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't think that makes him\Nlike the snake princess, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.18,0:18:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in a class of his own,\Nas dangerous as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.18,0:18:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Sakazuki to mobilize\Nthe admirals right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.82,0:18:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Worst case scenario, things\Ncould go wrong very quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.26,0:19:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be the biggest challenge\Nhe's faced as fleet admiral for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.54,0:19:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the biggest in his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.90,0:19:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you've been warned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.42,0:19:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,One last thing—don't\Ntell anyone you saw me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.14,0:19:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.90,0:19:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,word gets out then uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.88,0:19:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Who
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.86,0:19:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.77,0:19:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Never
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.72,0:19:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,mind then later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.02,0:19:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,later
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.96,0:19:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We've made it to the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.82,0:19:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No enemy sighted anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.84,0:19:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, no enemy's found on my patrol either.\NGood work. At ease, soldier. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.38,0:19:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are we safe yet or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:19:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How many people are looking for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.88,0:20:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a whole army?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.02,0:20:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid the second I lay down,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.02,0:20:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo's gonna swoop\Nin and kill me in my sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.58,0:20:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna get all of us killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.72,0:20:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He gave us these cool helmets!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.62,0:20:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet we're, like, invincible now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.60,0:20:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Designing from the warlords of the seer,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.40,0:20:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,go into battle with one\Nof the four emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.66,0:20:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, he'll pass on both\Nand come kill us if he's wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.08,0:20:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.62,0:20:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop fleeing and face your\Npunishment, you spineless coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.54,0:20:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't jump to conclusions.\NIt's complicated. Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.54,0:20:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you stop fighting on the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.50,0:20:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna sink us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.68,0:20:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys playing Samurai? Fight! Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.54,0:20:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you no shame?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.88,0:20:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The wanted kingdom heartbroken!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.38,0:20:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The brave of our hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.04,0:20:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Defiled!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.95,0:20:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I couldn't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.88,0:20:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I to believe that our hero\NRyuba's legendary blade, Chopper,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.32,0:20:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,simply fell into your lap?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:20:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a real pal, Samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.62,0:21:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut them in half for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.40,0:21:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, how's the midnight\Nsnack sound? Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.58,0:21:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's on the menu? Pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.18,0:21:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Pita?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.14,0:21:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not familiar with this dish by name,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.60,0:21:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,but if your chef made\Nit, I'm eager to try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.56,0:21:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Momonosuke go to bed already?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.56,0:21:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's taking a bath with Robin right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.42,0:21:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.98,0:21:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't had a chance to bathe\Nin days, have you? Quite true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.88,0:21:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all nice and warm now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.28,0:21:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.19,0:21:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Most relaxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.82,0:21:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.00,0:21:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon, he needs some\Nclothes, if you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.42,0:21:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you grinning about,\Nyou dirty little brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We can see right through\Nthat act of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.24,0:21:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can get away with\Nthis just because you're a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.42,0:21:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You must now cut off\Nyour top knot and shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.96,0:22:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you ganging\Nup on a child, you jerks?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.98,0:22:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a man in his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.52,0:22:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not let him fool you, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.54,0:22:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Say I feel the part of the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.96,0:22:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm a princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.46,0:22:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I won't disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.24,0:22:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, you're such a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.90,0:22:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You sleep with me and Robin tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.56,0:22:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.47,0:22:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Their bedroom is a secret garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.36,0:22:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.90,0:22:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.81,0:22:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a filthy little devil. I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.84,0:22:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I just know Doflamingo's gonna\Nsneak up on us in the dead of night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.72,0:22:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting over with already, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.40,0:22:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Better yet, just don't come at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.54,0:22:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We can never fall asleep again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.08,0:22:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the horizon is all clear. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.66,0:23:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.22,0:23:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there's a story about Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.30,0:23:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It says here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.28,0:23:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He resigned!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.70,0:23:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And he gave up the throne of Dressrosa?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.14,0:23:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.48,0:23:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, if he had a throne, then\Ndoesn't that mean he was a king?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.62,0:23:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Him, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.53,0:23:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would that guy rule over?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.46,0:23:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Birds, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.70,0:23:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't to be a downer,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.82,0:23:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but don't you think this whole thing's\Nworking out to be a little too convenient?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.48,0:23:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.38,0:23:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, since he didn't\Nhave a choice in the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.52,0:23:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.64,0:23:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a picture of\Nme and Traffy in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.32,0:23:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar Law of the Seven Warlords?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.12,0:24:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Forms an alliance with\Nthe Straw Hat Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.06,0:24:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It remains to be seen how the government\Nwill choose to punish Law. Oh dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.30,0:24:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure is a lot going on in the world today!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.40,0:24:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dove Lamingo quit the Warlords and\Nnow Law's working with the Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.68,0:24:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, to top it all off, Captain\NKidd, Scratchman, Apu, Basil Hawkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.14,0:24:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It says the Kidd Pirates,\Nthe Honor Pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.74,0:24:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Hawkins Pirates have\Nformed an alliance though too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.60,0:24:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, today's news just\Nkeeps getting crazier.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.34,0:24:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.72,0:24:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the troublemakers we've\Nbeen keeping an eye on for two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.92,0:24:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So why are they in\Ncahoots all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.24,0:24:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like things are about\Nto get intense in the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.62,0:24:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.56,0:24:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe all those crews have\Ndecided to join forces like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.88,0:24:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just like we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.46,0:24:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we had the right idea, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.40,0:24:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.36,0:24:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stick with our original plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.52,0:24:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll keep our focus on Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.12,0:25:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.12,0:25:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday's negotiation was more\Ncrucial for him than you realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.36,0:25:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,All we did was kidnap Caesar, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.84,0:25:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet practically overnight,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.66,0:25:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,he gave up not only the throne he's\Nbeen sitting on for the past 10 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.98,0:25:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but also the government's Carrot\Nblanc he was given as a privilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.90,0:25:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,when he became a warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.54,0:25:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If he did that just to get Caesar back,\Nthat should tell us a lot about his motives.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.38,0:25:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please answer us, your majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.64,0:25:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me—you'll be happy to\Nknow I've resigned. Resigned.
